5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! Let's make sure we get the fee structure just right this year so nobody is surprised. I'll look into the bank statements on last year's renewals and the tally of the sign-in sheets!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I think it's important to understand why some people are hesitant to attend. I'll look into the weekday turnout since the summer outings and the quieter members at the winter social.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to see who's actually doing the work and who's just coasting. I'll check the rota against the attendance record and the tally of the sign-in sheets.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to understand the actual workload involved in managing the finances. I'll look into the outgoing treasurer's logged hours and last year's ledger of outgoings.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to see how new people are feeling and how they're joining in! I'll check the sign-up records for mid-year joiners and the taster evening forms from non-joiners.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
