34,2,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"It's a bit worrying! A lot of people are struggling to pay on time, and some members aren't showing up at all. We really can't just guess the numbers this time!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It seems there is a growing hesitation among some members. I've noticed that when costs are tied too closely to specific events, people stop treating our gatherings as a natural part of their routine.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Takumi,,It's worse than I thought. A tiny group is doing all the heavy lifting while a huge chunk of members barely show up. It's not fair that everyone pays the same.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The fixed costs for the hall and insurance are quite high, regardless of attendance. Also, the administrative burden of chasing small payments is significantly higher than a single yearly collection.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,I found out that a lot of people who visit us for taster evenings don't join because they're scared of committing to a whole year's fee at once! Even mid-year joiners need a lot of help with calculations.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, if chasing payments is such a pain, maybe we need a system that's easier to manage but still fair? I'm really worried about the budget if people can't pay upfront.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, while I understand the desire for fairness, I worry that making fees too strictly tied to attendance might increase that feeling of hesitation. We want members to feel they belong without weighing the cost.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, belonging is great, but it's not fair to the people who are actually here every week. Why should the people doing all the work subsidize those who never show up?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"If we move toward a pay-as-you-go system to satisfy that sense of fairness, we risk burning out whoever manages the books. The time spent chasing small sums is a hidden cost we can't ignore.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, I get that it feels unfair, but I don't want people to feel like they're being watched or judged for not coming. We should make it easy for everyone to just drift in!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Kenji, I love the idea of people drifting in, but we can't ignore the bank statements! If people are already struggling to pay, we need a structure that's predictable for us and affordable for them.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Toshio, I agree that administrative simplicity is a virtue. However, if we make the entry barrier too high or too rigid, we might lose the quiet presence of those who only visit occasionally.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Kenji, it's not about judging them, it's about the people who are actually here! We can't just let people ""drift in"" for free while a few of us do all the work.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"We must balance the members' flexibility with the treasurer's sanity. If we prioritize ""drifting in"" over a structured collection, we are essentially volunteering someone's entire evening for bookkeeping. That is a price too high to pay.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Toshio, I didn't think about the treasurer's time! But if we make it too strict, we'll keep losing those taster guests. Can't we find a way to be simple and welcoming at the same time?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"I think we're all seeing the same problem from different angles! We need a way to keep the club welcoming and fair, but we absolutely must have a predictable income that doesn't kill the treasurer.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
51,2,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
52,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. We should aim for a structure that removes the mental burden of deciding whether to attend, while remaining sustainable for the club's administration.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
53,2,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
54,2,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm not going to let the people who actually keep this club running get cheated. We need a system that rewards the regulars and stops the ghost members from getting a free ride.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
55,2,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
56,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"Regardless of the fairness for members, the system must be sustainable for the staff. If the process is too complex, the role will remain vacant. I'll be interested to see the options.
Toshio:","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
57,2,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
58,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I hope we can find a middle ground! I really want our new friends to feel welcome without making the treasurer's life a nightmare. I'm looking forward to seeing the options too!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
59,2,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
